00:27:03.410 --> 00:27:04.490
<i>I just don't know!</i>

00:27:06.620 --> 00:27:11.080
<i>How should I act around him
when he's trying to win his crush's heart?</i>

00:27:31.980 --> 00:27:33.270
<i>But I...</i>

00:27:33.270 --> 00:27:34.900
